        "She continued: \"It's not because of the money. It's because you can tolerate it for a few months, keep all your doubts in your heart, and then suddenly, without warning, do something irreversibly destructive.\"",
        "This sentence is sharper than those vicious comments on the Internet, and more deadly than Charles' suspicion.",
        "Adrian turned around: \"She did break the deal.\"",
        "\"I know.\"",
        "\"I'm not wrong.\"",
        "\"You're not 'all wrong'.\"",
        "\"You sound exactly like Helena right now.\"",
        "\"Maybe Helena didn't do everything wrong after all.\"",
        "He stared at her in disbelief.",
        "Celia bit her lip. \"I didn't mean that-\"",
        "\"That's what you meant.\"",
        "\"I mean, human nature is complicated, and people do terrible things, and the reasons behind them are often not that simple.\"",
        "\"So this deserves forgiveness?\"",
        "\"No.\"",
        "\"Then what exactly do you want to say?\"",
        "“I wanted to say that I didn’t know if I could marry into a family where every disagreement escalated into a trial of loyalty and where every legal document hid a deadly trap.”",
        "Adrian felt the air in the room contract violently.",
        "\"Do you want to break off the engagement?\"",
        "\"I'm just asking for a night where I don't have to make an immediate decision.\"",
        "He looked at the engagement ring on her left hand.",
