        "Elizabeth Vale's handwriting slopes all the way down, and the handwriting is crowded, showing a strong anxiety. She didn't scream in her letter that Helena had stolen her family. She simply asked Adrian eagerly if he would leave the hallway light on while he slept at night. She asked Charles if he was allowed to sneak into the kitchen and eat while he was having a party. She even asked if anyone had told him that she felt extremely sorry and regretful about that rainy night.",
