        "Ruth didn't even hum.",
        "Veronica put on her shoes, and when the hard heel strap pinched the broken skin, she grimaced in pain. She tried adjusting it twice, but finally gave up and stepped on the strap directly.",
        "This small, life-like movement made Daniel feel agitated for no reason. A mad woman who had just bombarded his living room with a deadly weapon was now squeamishly caring about a broken blister. His anger desperately wanted her to remain pure evil, but the remaining humanity in her was constantly breaking down his anger.",
        "He took out the office key from the secret compartment of the entrance drawer.",
