        "Daniel immediately recognized the oppressive handwriting that tilted to the lower right corner, as well as the capital letters that were written too hard - this was the muscle memory left by Howard's old-school boarding school, where if he made a mistake in writing a word, the teacher would slap his knuckles hard with a ruler.",
        "Ruth,",
