        "\"What if I don't want him to get arrested?\"",
        "The room was still quiet.",
        "Experienced people know that you should not make a fuss when dealing with a victim.",
        "\"It's very common,\" Diana said.",
        "Chloe looked a little ashamed. \"I know that sounds pathetic.\"",
        "\"It just sounds very human.\"",
        "\"I hate him. I guess I should. But I also...\" She rubbed her eyes with her fingers. \"Yesterday morning, he made coffee and kissed my forehead. He said he loved me. He said that as long as I stopped fighting him, we could go back to the happy days we had before. There was a voice in my head that kept saying, maybe if I just wait a while before buying that shirt, or tell him in advance-\"",
        "\"No.\" I said.",
        "The tone was too harsh.",
