        "\"Great.\"",
        "\"I'm here to ask if you will be present at the trustees' review on Thursday.\"",
        "\"I've been testifying for three hours.\"",
        "\"They want to ask questions face to face.\"",
        "\"Will Victoria be there?\"",
        "\"Here.\"",
        "\"Where's Arthur?\"",
        "\"Here.\"",
        "\"Where's Claire?\"",
        "\"Here.\"",
        "\"What about you?\"",
        "\"Here.\"",
        "Nora crossed her arms. \"Why?\"",
        "\"Because there was evidence on the recovered tablet that its audio notes were deleted after security personnel took over.\"",
        "\"Who did it?\"",
        "\"A senior security administrator exploited Dana's credentials.\"",
        "\"Did Dana give them permission?\"",
        "\"She said no.\"",
        "\"Do you believe it?\"",
        "\"Letter.\"",
        "\"Who is the administrator?\"",
        "\"Gerald Pike.\"",
        "Nora knew the name. Pike worked at the museum for fourteen years. He approves employee badges and lectures new employees, telling them to never let familiarity weaken procedures.",
        "\"Why did he delete it?\"",
        "\"His wife was paid to work as a consultant for a Vale Development subsidiary.\"",
        "Nora felt a little cold.",
        "\"Did Victoria tell him to do this?\"",
        "\"We don't know.\"",
        "\"You don't know?\"",
        "\"He said it was to protect Arthur's privacy by protecting the museum from unauthorized recordings.\"",
        "\"This is simply not believable.\"",
        "\"It may be partially believable to her.\"",
        "\"Do you still have the notes?\"",
        "\"The cloud backup has been restored.\"",
        "\"What's recorded on it?\"",
        "\"The audio notes record Arthur's admission that Victoria had concealed debts from the development proposal and intended to appoint an independent trustee before the end of the dinner.\"",
        "\"Then it wasn't Victoria who did it?\"",
        "\"She didn't give the order herself.\"",
        "\"Can you prove it?\"",
        "\"Can't.\"",
        "\"What will happen?\"",
        "\"The trustees will decide whether Arthur's appointment is voluntary and whether they can accept it without prejudice to the interests of the foundation.\"",
        "\"It sounds like they can choose whatever answer is best for them.\"",
        "\"They can.\"",
        "\"What do you want me to say?\"",
        "\"The truth.\"",
        "Nora smiled. \"Which version?\"",
        "\"All.\"",
        "She looked up at him. \"You want me to say Arthur asked me to lure her away.\"",
        "\"Yes.\"",
        "\"You want me to say I lied.\"",
        "\"Yes.\"",
        "\"You want me to admit that before Victoria even raised her hand, I concluded she was dangerous.\"",
        "\"Yes.\"",
        "\"This will help Victoria.\"",
        "\"Maybe.\"",
        "\"Then why?\"",
        "\"If we provide a polished version and she exposes the rough edges, the trustee will become suspicious of everything. If you voluntarily disclose the rough edges yourself, they may believe the really important parts.\"",
        "\"That's when she wanted to hit him.\"",
        "\"Yes.\"",
        "Nora stood up.",
        "\"You're risking my case.\"",
        "\"Yes.\"",
        "\"My job.\"",
        "\"Yes.\"",
        "\"My honor.\"",
        "\"Yes.\"",
        "He didn't soften any of his answers.",
        "Nora said, \"What are you risking?\"",
        "\"My chairmanship.\"",
        "\"That's the risk you're taking.\"",
        "\"No. I have decided to resign after the vote, regardless of the outcome.\"",
        "She looked him over.",
        "\"Why?\"",
        "\"Because I allowed the Foundation to become dependent on one family's fear of losing control. I call that stability.\"",
        "\"Sounds like a speech.\"",
        "\"Longer in the car.\"",
