        "\"Yes.\"",
        "Rain lapped at the window behind him.",
        "Malcolm reached into his coat and placed a folded paper on the table. It was a copy of a memo he had sent to the board three months earlier, advising Arthur to postpone the trust changes and consult with Victoria.",
        "Nora read the first page.",
        "\"You're against him.\"",
