        "A social dinner. Friends of friends. Ethan Cole smiled at each other in a crowded room and introduced himself over a plate of terrible red wine and exquisite desserts. consultant. charming. Thoughtful. The man who inquired about my father and expressed genuine sadness when I told him he was dead.",
