        "## Chapter 5: The Trust Draft",
        "I noticed.",
        "Naomi sat down at the small dining table and opened her briefcase. \"I reviewed the documents you sent me. The property is still in your name and has not been transferred, which is great. But there are two issues here.\"",
        "There are only two of them, I thought ridiculously to myself.",
        "It sounds like it's still under control.",
        "\"First,\" Naomi continued, \"Ethan's interest in your assets has obviously exceeded the scope of a newlywed husband. And the second problem is even more worrying.\"",
        "She spread a document flat on the table.",
